### Credit Card Authorizer Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### ==========================================
### Test 1: Valid card - Should authorize 90% of the time (200) or decline 10% (402)
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": "1234-5678-9012-3456"
}

### ==========================================
### Test 2: Invalid format - No dashes - Should return 400
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": "1234567890123456"
}

### ==========================================
### Test 3: Invalid format - Wrong grouping - Should return 400
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": "123-4567-8901-23456"
}

### ==========================================
### Test 4: Invalid format - Spaces instead of dashes - Should return 400
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": "1234 5678 9012 3456"
}

### ==========================================
### Test 5: Invalid format - Missing digits - Should return 400
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": "1234-5678-9012-345"
}

### ==========================================
### Test 6: Invalid format - Letters included - Should return 400
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": "1234-5678-ABCD-3456"
}

### ==========================================
### Test 7: Null card number - Should return 400
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": null
}

### ==========================================
### Test 8: Missing field - Should return 400
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### ==========================================
### Test 9: Different valid card - Run this 10 times to verify 90/10 split
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": "9999-8888-7777-6666"
}

### ==========================================
### Test 10: Edge case - All zeros
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/credit-card-authorizer/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credit_card_number": "0000-0000-0000-0000"
}